ata-minimap-color=\"#CCCCCC\">此处的坐标系称为模型坐标系，如果需要将其摆放出来，实际上就是对每一个顶点做变换将其放置在世界坐标中的某一个位置，比如可以放大缩小，位移平移旋转等。</div><svg class=\"std-para\" viewBox=\"50 30 330 260\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:14rem;height:auto;display:inline-block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"cube-arrow-slate\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1 L 5 3 L 0 5 z\" fill=\"#64748b\"></path></marker></defs><g><circle cx=\"207\" cy=\"168\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#000\"></circle><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"></line><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"></line><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"></line><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></line><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></line><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></line><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></line><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></line><rect x=\"110\" y=\"110\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\" fill-opacity=\"0.05\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"60\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"></circle><text x=\"175\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"&#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, Times, serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">V<tspan font-style=\"normal\" font-size=\"10\" dy=\"2.5\">4</tspan></text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"60\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#b91c1c\"></circle><text x=\"328\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"&#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, Times, serif\"