token operator\">:</span> Mat4 <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n<span class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"user-select: none;\">01</span>  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> commands<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> React<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">JSX</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Element<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"user-select: none;\">02</span>  <span class=\"token function\">renderCube</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>commands<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> props<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">M</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> props<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">V</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"user-select: none;\">03</span>  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>commands<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"user-select: none;\">04</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></pre></div><div class=\"std-para --fontArticle\" data-minimap-color=\"#CCCCCC\">然后绑一下 DOM 操作，依据操作修改 Camera 设定，简单写一下顶点可见性检查，使其看起来更像游戏：</div><div class=\"std-para --fontArticle\" data-minimap-color=\"#CCCCCC\">备注: React 表示 “什么？停下！你让我来渲染 3D 吗 ？”</div><h1 id=\"eof\" class=\"std-title --fontTitle\"><a href=\"#eof\" class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\">#</a> EOF<i data-minimap=\"Ignore\"> ↵ </i></h1><div class=\"std-para --fontArticle\" data-minimap-color=\"#CCCCCC\">将 3D 场景渲染到 2D 屏幕上没有想象中的复杂，理解 MV 变换的原理即可实现上屏绘制，本文给出了一个粗糙的实现。</div><div class=\"std-para --fontArticle\" data-minimap-color=\"#CCCCCC\">但实际上还有很多细节问题需要考虑，比如你可以尝试滚轮放大到最大或操作 WASD 走出 cube，然后背对着 cube 看看，能看到很多貌似是渲染的问题，实际上要解决这些必须重新审视视锥体和透视成像 P 矩阵的具体细节，本文限于篇幅和个人精力就不展开了 （估计还是会写233，等我有空）</div><div class=\"std-img-dynamic-wrapper --fontArticle\"><div class=\"std-img-dynamic\" data-minimap=\"Rect\" style=\"padding-bottom:55.80%\"><img class=\"std-img-dymanic-main r-link __mosaic __loading\" src=\"/tsxs-esm/eof.c9252a5c25f548ea.png.mosaic.png\"/><img class=\"std-img-dymanic-main\" src=\"/tsxs-esm/eof.c9252a5c25f548ea.png\" data-width=\"3000\" data-height=\"1674\"/></div></div>","props":{},"renderInfo":{"tocStack":[{"id":"how-to-draw-3d-content","level":1,"text":"如何绘制 3D 内容"},{"id":"common-vector-calc","level":1,"text":"常用向量计算"},{"id":"transform-by-the-cases-of-equation","level":1,"text":"用方程组表达变换"},{"id":"common-matrix-operation","level":1,"text":"常用矩阵操作"},{"id":"transform-and-inverse-transform","level":1,"text":"理解连续变换与逆变换"},{"id":"cube-coordinate-system-and-vertices","level":1,"text":"Cube 的坐标系和 8 个顶点"},{"id":"m-matrix-from-cube-to-world","level":1,"text":"M 矩阵：从模型坐标到世界坐标"},{"id":"cube-and-perspective-division","level":1,"text":"Camera 与透视除法"},{"id":"camera-in-the-world","level":1,"text":"世界坐标系中的摄像机"},{"id":"basis-vector-is-all-you-need","level":1,"text":"更好的数学思想: Basis Vector is all you nned"},{"id":"v-matrix-from-world-to-camera","level":1,"text":"V 矩阵：从世界坐标到摄像机坐标"},{"id":"svg-render-3d-cube","level":1,"text":"用 SVG 渲染一个 3D Cube"},{"id":"gaming-cube","level":1,"text":"Gaming Cube"},{"id":"eof","level":1,"text":"EOF"}]}}}